    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f46a55e3adadd5e3bd747163b6ca7a4a.poster.avif?t=1752791371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f46a55e3adadd5e3bd747163b6ca7a4a.webm?t=1752791371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f46a55e3adadd5e3bd747163b6ca7a4a.mp4?t=1752791371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Princess (voiced by ShadowgamingVA), a high-maintenance 21-year-old girl who earned the nickname through her bratty behavior. After running away from home at 16, she worked dead-end job after dead-end job in order to survive and manage her addiction to a pain pill called Numb-X. The story begins with her waking up in a forest late at night during a rainstorm after getting knocked unconscious and robbed of all her belongings. Through a strange series of events, she unlocks a new power that will change her life forever. You will help guide Princess to get her life together, manage her relationships and, most importantly, prevent the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting for all Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Romanceable Characters who each have their own stories to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 10-20 hours of Playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Emotional Story with many highs and lows. Inspired by other great Visual Novels such as Fate Stay/Night, Tsukihime, Sekien no Inganock and the Milk series.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Others</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/963fac6b482f1d708b6ea65de56dafa0.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/d280b0a4c6e4d125d65beee098e7d38b.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f1b89ad1c16f06cf63c0aed8cc09301f.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/d81da9984422ac5b0d12d02b78d9b620.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/7548432c9be2d4834840255cb045e4ed.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f3354553304f44150728c034cb9dbb07.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f46a55e3adadd5e3bd747163b6ca7a4a.poster.avif?t=1752791371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f46a55e3adadd5e3bd747163b6ca7a4a.webm?t=1752791371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f46a55e3adadd5e3bd747163b6ca7a4a.mp4?t=1752791371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Princess (voiced by ShadowgamingVA), a high-maintenance 21-year-old girl who earned the nickname through her bratty behavior. After running away from home at 16, she worked dead-end job after dead-end job in order to survive and manage her addiction to a pain pill called Numb-X. The story begins with her waking up in a forest late at night during a rainstorm after getting knocked unconscious and robbed of all her belongings. Through a strange series of events, she unlocks a new power that will change her life forever. You will help guide Princess to get her life together, manage her relationships and, most importantly, prevent the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting for all Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Romanceable Characters who each have their own stories to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 10-20 hours of Playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Emotional Story with many highs and lows. Inspired by other great Visual Novels such as Fate Stay/Night, Tsukihime, Sekien no Inganock and the Milk series.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Others</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/963fac6b482f1d708b6ea65de56dafa0.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/d280b0a4c6e4d125d65beee098e7d38b.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f1b89ad1c16f06cf63c0aed8cc09301f.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/d81da9984422ac5b0d12d02b78d9b620.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/7548432c9be2d4834840255cb045e4ed.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730050/extras/f3354553304f44150728c034cb9dbb07.avif?t=1752791371\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
